<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.01 points off FTSE, Aug 4.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.01 points off FTSE, Aug 4.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks</p>
<p>will go ex-dividend on August 4 and analysts estimate the effect</p>
<p>will be to take 1.01 points off the index on Monday.</p>
<p>				     DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>				     (PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		COMPANY	     Net	 Net</p>
<p>* Associated British Foods    4.25	0.217</p>
<p>* Reuters Holdings		3.10	0.298</p>
<p>* Scottish &amp; Newcastle	14.17	0.496</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
